<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop 1995/96 sales edge higher.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop 1995/96 sales edge higher.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1995/96</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
